odding at both.\n\nSomeone looks up from a table, sees me in the window, and waves me in like I'm late for something. I go to step through, but the window frame is made of semicolons. I realize I don't know whether I'm supposed to end the line here or keep going.\n\nSo I keep going.\n\nThe floor becomes a long scroll of text, and my footsteps leave autocomplete suggestions behind them. They're mostly wrong, but kind. The scroll goes on for a long way, and somewhere ahead there's a blinking cursor waiting, like a lighthouse.\n\nShould I go toward the cursor, or turn back to the library?", "finished_at": "2026-10-07T20:34:09.119651+00:00", "inference_provider": null, "inference_route": null, "inputs": [], "migration": null, "mode": "agent", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "claude", "provider_duration_seconds": null, "provider_error": null, "provider_reported_cost": null, "provider_status": null, "response_available": true, "run_id": "917cb767-a0b6-477e-a576-92e6caa7ff3f", "session_id": "b02e867e-1817-4c83-abc7-9b1866fe2931", "started_at": "2026-10-07T20:34:00.059248+00:00", "status": "succeeded", "succeeded": true, "task": "35c867e2-8067-4cf9-8e55-2808269b6de3", "time_to_first_event_seconds": 0.344795, "time_to_first_response_seconds": 8.64651, "timed_out": false, "usage": {"cached_input_tokens": 13877, "input_tokens": 14362, "output_tokens": 504, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0}, "usage_schema": "aop-token-usage-v3"}
